[Yuan Shikai](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yuan_Shikai "Yuan Shikai") to head the government. The imperial government [collapsed](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xinhai_Revolution "Xinhai Revolution") soon afterward.

[Zhang Xun](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zhang_Xun_%28Qing_loyalist%29 "Zhang Xun (Qing loyalist)") briefly held the post during his [attempt](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manchu_Restoration "Manchu Restoration") to restore the [Qing dynasty](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Qing_dynasty "Qing dynasty") in July 1917.

